<title>FINLAND: FINNISH BONDS OFF HIGHS BUT OUTPERFORM BUNDS.</title>
<headline>FINNISH BONDS OFF HIGHS BUT OUTPERFORM BUNDS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Bonds were firmer in calm</p>
<p>midsession dealings amid strong international tone but yields</p>
<p>ticked off lows on profit-taking in markka bonds, dealers said.</p>
<p>The gap over Bunds narrowed as the finance ministry's</p>
<p>proposal for a lower budget deficit gave positive undertone,</p>
<p>they said. The ministry said on Tuesday the deficit would be 17</p>
<p>billion markka instead of 21 billion earlier planned.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
